OL,3,GNEWSAMinister signed hospital deal
OL,4,Adespite concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's health minister signed a
OL,7,Fmultimillion-pound contract to build a
OL,8,Fnew hospital at Overdale before work to
OL,9,Freview the deal concluded, and despite
OL,10,Fconcerns of officials and a fellow
OL,11,Fminister.
OL,13,FThe government announced on 5 June it
OL,14,Fhad agreed a deal with building firm
OL,15,FBouygues UK.
OL,17,FWhen it was confirmed as preferred
OL,18,Fbidder in November 2025, Tom Binet said
OL,19,Fa contract would be signed in "early"
OL,20,F2026. But in April he said "detailed
OL,21,Fconsideration" was still required.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
