OL,3,GNEWSAMinister signed hospital deal
OL,4,Adespite concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has emerged that, on 3 June - four
OL,7,Fdays before 2026's election - Binet
OL,8,Ftold his senior civil servants to
OL,9,Ffinalise the deal "in advance of
OL,10,Finternal sign-offs" as "on a balance of
OL,11,Frisks" he was worried about project
OL,12,Fcost increases.
